-- Every module of the corpus, so the whole thing can be checked in ONE
-- run: the loader deduplicates by module name, so each dependency
-- elaborates once instead of once per importer.
--
-- Since the lemma store is scoped to a module's import closure, a
-- module elaborates here exactly as it does standalone — the order of
-- the imports below does not matter, and this file subsumes the
-- per-file sweep. check-elaborations.sh verifies the list is complete.

